2 CONT BYRON OLIVER" (Philander11"1 and Polly Matilda (Merrill), Charles,TM Eli,"1 Benjamin," Benjamin,1" Isaac,2 George1), b. 29 Nov., 1848, in Council Bluffs, Iowa; mar. Sarah Jane Clark, 24 Jan., 1870, in Salt Lake City. She was b. 31
2 CONC  Dec., 1852, in Provo City, Utah, and d. in Mona, Juab Co., Utah, 22 Aug., 1875. He mar., second, Sarah Maria Smith, in Prove, 4 July, 1879. She was b. in Provo City, 1 Jan., 1856. He is a farmer and stock raiser in Vernal, Uinta 
2 CONC Co., Utah; has been clerk and recorder for the county for several years.
