1 NOTE {geni:about_me} The following information was obtained from Eleanor's death certificate (Name listed on death certificate is Rosetta Eleanor Jones but gravestone shows Eleanor Rosetta):
2 CONT
2 CONT Eleanor was born to Francis Martin Pomory (b. Connecticut) and Jessamine Rutledge (b. England).
2 CONT
2 CONT Eleanor was married to Edwin Wesley Jones (also buried in Mesa Cemetery) and was a widow at the time of her death. She was a housewife.
2 CONT
2 CONT Eleanor died in Mesa, Maricopa Co., Arizona at the age of 77. Cause of death is listed as Coronary Thrombosis (heart attack) due to Arterioclerosis.
2 CONT
2 CONT Eleanor was laid to rest on March 5, 1941 in the Mesa Cemetery.
