2 CONT In the early days in Ashley Valley when there were no doctors there, Mrs. Colton endeared herself to the community by ministering to the sick.
2 CONT
2 CONT Mrs. Colton was an active worker in the LDS Church and civic organiazations. She was president of the Young Ladies' Mutual Improvement Association and Relief Society of Maeser Ward and was later president of the Uintah Stake Relie
2 CONC f Society.
