2 CONT
2 CONT "...'''Caroline Marie Williams''', a daughter of Thomas and Albina, who went with them on the Battalion march, was born on April 24, 1843, in Nauvoo, Illinois. She married David Patten Kimball in 1857. They moved to Thatcher, Ariz
2 CONC ona, where she died on December 21, 1916, and was buried at St. David, Arizona. She was the mother of ten children..."
