2 CONT
2 CONT Approximate age at departure: 14
2 CONT
2 CONT [http://www.findagrave.com/cgi-bin/fg.cgi?page=gr&GRid=44454815 Find a Grave]
2 CONT
2 CONT Birth: 	May 3, 1835
2 CONT
2 CONT Death: 	Apr. 10, 1901
2 CONT
2 CONT Family links: 
2 CONT  Parents:
2 CONT *Daniel Collett (1808 - 1894)
2 CONT *Esther Jones Collett (1814 - 1857)
2 CONT
2 CONT Burial: Cokeville Cemetery Cokeville Lincoln County Wyoming, USA
2 CONT
2 CONT Created by: Carol STEVENS Record added: Nov 16, 2009 Find A Grave Memorial# 44454815
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT 1900 US Census shows 1841. New York Passenger List for his father, Daniel, shows arriving in New York, New York, on 16 Jun 1840
2 CONT
2 CONT LDS Website. Collett's came with the Samuel Gully/Orson Spencer Company in 1849. Father, Daniel 40, mother, Esther Jones 34, Sisters, Elizabeth-infant, Mary Ann-2, Rhoda Sylvia-12, Brother, Reuben-9. Sylvanus is listed as 14.
2 CONT
2 CONT US Federal Census. Parents, Daniel & Esther. Children, Sylvanus-16, Rhoda S-14, Reuben-11, Mary A-4, Elizabeth-2. All born in England except Mary & Elizabeth who were born in Iowa.
2 CONT
2 CONT Married Lydia Karren in Utah in 1853
2 CONT
2 CONT  (bio by: [fg.cgi?page=mr&MRid=47022961" target="_blank Susan McKinney Raymond)]
