2 CONT   Phoebe Odell Merrill (1788 - 1862)
2 CONT
2 CONT  Spouses:
2 CONT   Cyrena Dustin Merrill (1817 - 1906)
2 CONT   Mary Jane Smith Merrill (1833 - 1871)*
2 CONT   Rhoda Sylvia Collett Merrill (1837 - 1927)*
2 CONT
2 CONT  Children:
2 CONT   Philemon C. Merrill (1845 - 1897)*
2 CONT   Morgan Henry Merrill (1850 - 1896)*
2 CONT   Thomas Stephen Merrill (1853 - 1912)*
2 CONT   Seth Adelbert Merrill (1859 - 1901)*
2 CONT   Hannah Ann Merrill Collett (1860 - 1916)*
