2 CONC  so fast; it literally poured.  Every little gulch and ravine was running streams.  One just above camp would swim a horse in an hour after it commenced to rain.  After that it cleared off and has not looked like rain since.  The 
2 CONC river raised where it is narrow fifteen feet.  Where we are camped it is quite wide but it rained 7 or 8 inches.  John and Newell live closer to the bank and on lower ground than the rest of us.  They came pretty near having to mo
2 CONC ve.
