1 NAME Rebecca Ann /Sanders/
2 GIVN Rebecca Ann
2 SURN Sanders
2 _MARNM Sanderson
1 SEX F
1 BURI
2 ADDR
3 CITY Fairview
3 STAE Utah
3 CTRY United States of America
1 BIRT
2 DATE 5 MAR 1832
