1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 83. ISRAEL9 MERRILL (DANIEL8, JOHN7 *MERRILL, NATHANIEL6, NATHANIEL5, JOHN4 *MERRELL, THE YOUNGER, JOHN3 *MERYELL, JOHN2, THOMAS1) was born Bef. April 15, 1716 in Hartford, Hartford, Conn, and died October 15, 1784
2 CONC  in West Hartford, Hartford, Conn. He married (1) BETHIAH (.....) MERRILL Abt. 1739. She was born Aft. 1716, and died 1740. He married (2) ABIGAIL CADWELL 1741, daughter of THOMAS CADWELL and HANNAH FRANCIS. She was born January 5
2 CONC , 1722/23 in Hartford, Hartford, Conn, and died Unknown.
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes for ISRAEL MERRILL: From "A Merrill Memorial" by Samuel Merrill, Cambridge, MA 1917-1928
2 CONT
2 CONT Israel(4) Merrill (Daniel(3), John(2)) was born in Hartford, CT where he was baptised 15 Apr 1716 and died 15 Oct 1784 in West Hartford. He lived on the homestead farm, which he received under his father's will and owned a tannery
2 CONC . He married (1) Bethiah ??? and (2) in 1741 Abigail Cadwell, daughter of Thomas and Hannah (Francis) Cadwell. Abigail Cadwell was born 5 Jan 1722/3 in Hartford.
2 CONT
2 CONT Child of ISRAEL MERRILL and BETHIAH MERRILL is: i. LOIS10 MERRILL, b. Bef. May 4, 1740; m. ABRAHAM HUMPHREY, 1760.
2 CONT
