1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Thomas Jefferson Lutz was the son of Albert Ellis Lutz and Susannah Z. Dubois.   He married Mary Melissa Merrill, March 21, 1868, in Salt Lake City, Salt Lake, Utah.  
