1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Betty Darlene Hodgson, 74, passed away April 3, 2004 at home in Sun City, Arizona, after a long illness.  Darlene, as she was known to family and friends, was born in Phoenix, Arizona on November 2, 1929 to Carl Cl
2 CONC eon and Effie Isabelle Merrill Robinson. She married Glen Hodgson July 27, 1946. Darlene was a faithful member of The Church of Jesus Christ of Latter-Day Saints and was the spiritual leader of her family.
2 CONT
2 CONT Darlene is survived by her husband Glen, son Stephen L. (Christine) Hodgson and daughter Kim Ann Hodgson. She is also survived by eight grandchildren and 10 great-grandchildren. Three children, Glenda Lynn Nielsen, Glen Hodgson, J
2 CONC r. and Penny Kaye Hodgson, preceded her in death.
2 CONT
2 CONT Graveside services will be held at 11:00 a.m. on Saturday, April 10, 2004 at Bountiful City Cemetery in Bountiful, Utah. Arrangements by SereniCare, Funeral Directors.
2 CONT
2 CONT SOURCE:  Deseret News
