2 CONT ==Wikipedia Biographical Summary:==
2 CONT
2 CONT "...'''Christopher Layton''' (March 8, 1821 – August 7, 1898) was a Mormon colonizer and Patriarch who founded the cities of Kaysville, Utah, Layton, Utah, and Thatcher, Arizona. Layton, Utah is named after him..."
2 CONT
2 CONT "...Layton was born at Thorncote Green, Northill, Bedfordshire, England..."
2 CONT
