2 CONT === The Blessing I Call Dad "Poem" ===
2 CONT My Dad is the strength
2 CONT of the family he love, As bold as an eagle, and as peaceful a dove.
2 CONT
2 CONT A man of hard work that meets every need, Does all that he can that his children succeed.
2 CONT
2 CONT Content in the knowledge to do what is right, A blessing posterity, consecrated in light,
2 CONT
2 CONT In truth he uphold, faithful to the end, The family coat of arms, of which he defend.
2 CONT
2 CONT Heaven shines bright, his eternal reward, He builds, makes repairs in service to the Lord.
2 CONT
2 CONT Dad gains understanding when there is strife, Wise in his words and in dealing with life.
