2 CONT *Sarah Jane Richards Morrell (1833 - 1909)*
2 CONT *Martha Richards Cox (1839 - 1861)*
2 CONT *Frances Ann Richards Mower (1859 - 1946)*
2 CONT *Silas Newton Richards (1863 - 1929)*
2 CONT
2 CONT Burial: Union Cemetery Sandy Salt Lake County Utah, USA Plot: row H grave 20
2 CONT
