2 CONT Francis Maarion was a veteran of the Civil War.  In 1860 he married Mary
2 CONT Frances Welch (1844-1861).  They had one son, Lon.  After her death, he
2 CONT married Sarah Elizabeth Moore (1845-1908).  They had seven sons and two
2 CONT daughters.  She is the grandmother on our side of the family. [opal maude purdom 1903.FTW]
