1 NOTE {geni:about_me} The above photo was found on Family Search.org and depicts the family of William Passey and Asenath Viola Wilcox Passey including the following:  Back Row, Left to Right:  Frederick Orson Passey, Boyd, Malinda Cath
2 CONC erine, Samuel, Martha, James, and Joseph.  Center Row, Left to Right:  Albert, Commodore, William Passey (father) and Aseneth Viola Wilcox Passey (mother), and Adam.  Front Row, Left to Right:  Lorenzo, Asenath Becca, and Earnest 
2 CONC is on his mother's lap.  NOTE:  The photo had a caption which stated it was taken in 1889, however, Asenath Becca Passey was not born until 1895 and she passed away in 1904.  I would imagine that the photo was probably taken about
2 CONC  1900, since she looks to be no more than 4 or 5 years old in the photo.
