1 NOTE Nancy, now 64, is found in the 1860 Smyth Co, VA, census with son WilliamJ. Fulcher and niece Rosannah Atwell.  (My image 085)
2 CONT
2 CONT Census images say that Nancy was born in NC, but probably more reliableinformation comes from the Fulcher family bible kept by Mary HolidayFulcher Yohe, a granddaughter of Levi Franklin Fulcher.  According toLois Kimmons, it says 
2 CONC that Nancy was actually born in Virginia.  Thatmakes as much sense as anything else, given the fact that her parentswere married in Prince Edward County, VA, just shortly before Nancy wasborn.
