1 NOTE First found in Evanshaw Township, Wythe County, Virginia, in 1820.  (Myimage 193)  The census reports one male in the 26-45 age group (thatwould be Douglas who was 29), and two other males in the 16-26 agegroup.  It's possible tha
2 CONC t these were two of Nancy's brothers, possiblyWilliam Henry and Joseph who were about 19 and 20.  The Fulchers arestill in Wythe County, Virginia, in 1830 (My image 123), but are found inthe Smyth Co. census for 1850.  The Hannah 
2 CONC present in 1850 is the wife ofLevi.  On the same page is the family of Nancy's brother, William H.  (Myimage 319 and 764)  I've gone back and have saved a copy of the 1840census with them on it.  They are in Smyth County at that t
2 CONC ime.  (Myimage 888)
