1 NOTE The web posting of Smyth County, Virginia, marriages 1853-61 lists JohnF. Young as the groom and 'M.E. Pritchett' aged 16 as the bride in 1859.Assuming that the transcriber mistook an N for an M, I went looking forthe family and f
2 CONC ound them in 1880 Fairview, Sanpete County, Utah.  Thewife's name was confirmed to be Nancy, and further, a few families awaywas Nancy's brother John Pritchett.  (My images 259 and 260)  Furthersearching found them already in Sanp
2 CONC ete in 1870.  (My image 273)  Thatentry says that John's middle initial is 'M'.
2 CONT
