1 NAME Nelson Wheeler /Whipple/
2 GIVN Nelson Wheeler
2 SURN Whipple
2 _MARNM Whipple
1 SEX M
1 BURI
2 PLAC Salt Lake City Cemetery, Plot: A_7_3_5W
2 ADDR
3 CITY Salt Lake City
3 STAE Utah
3 CTRY United States
1 BIRT
2 DATE 11 JUL 1818
2 ADDR
3 CITY Sanford
3 STAE New York
3 CTRY United States
