2 DATE 5 JUL 1887
2 ADDR
3 CITY Salt Lake City
3 STAE Utah Territory
3 CTRY United States
1 OCCU LDS Seventy, Block teacher, Lumberman, Policeman
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Nelson Wheeler Whipple''', son of Daniel Whipple and Mary Tiffany, was born 7 July 1818, at Sanford, Broom County, New York. He came to Utah in 1848. He had three plural wives and 18 children. Families resided a
2 CONC t Salt Lake City. LDS Seventy; block teacher. Lumberman; made first shingles for the tabernacle. With army that met Johnston in Echo Canyon. Policeman. Died 5 July 1884.
2 CONT https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/44733617/nelson_wheeler-whipple
2 CONT ==Marriages and Children==
2 CONT #Susan Jane Bailey August 6, 1843, Elysia, Lorain County, Ohio, who was born 9 March 1828. Their children:
2 CONT ##Meranda Jane, married Henry Code;
2 CONT ##Mary, married Richard Waddems;
2 CONT ##George Nelson;
2 CONT ##Edson, married Mary Beck;
2 CONT ##Harriet Emily, died infant;
2 CONT ##Annie Bard.
2 CONT #Rachel Keeling West of Derbyshire, England, March 12, 1855, Salt Lake City, who was born March 10, 1818. Their children:
2 CONT ##Daniel, married Ellen Hearst;
2 CONT ##Cynthia, died infant;
2 CONT ##Wheeler born April 15, 1859, married Mary Roberts February 1, 1881.
2 CONT #Susan Ann Gay February 9, 1857, Salt Lake City (daughter of Alexander Gay and Martha Covington. De Kalb, Kemper county, Mississippi; former died at Mt. Pisgah, Iowa, on the way to Utah, latter pioneer 1850). She was born June 13,
2 CONC  1841, and came to Utah 1851, John Brown company. Their children:
2 CONT ##Martha Ellen, married Jacob Kesler;
2 CONT ##Nelson Gay, married Susanah Wanless;
2 CONT ##Sylvia, married Fred born Margetts;
2 CONT ##Susan Ann, married Archer W. Clayton;
2 CONT ##Alexander, married Sarah Vannotta;
2 CONT ##Robert John, married Susan Winn;
2 CONT ##Amy Jane, married John H. Evans;
2 CONT ##Ida, married Ezra O. Taylor;
2 CONT ##Annor.
2 CONT
