1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Daughter of Henry Weeks Sanderson and Rebecca Ann Sanders
2 CONT
2 CONT Married Charles Rigby, 27 Sep 1875, Salt Lake City, Salt Lake, Utah
2 CONT
2 CONT Children - Charles Henry Rigby, James Moroni Rigby, Lovinia Ann Rigby, William Elmer Rigby, Howard Weeks Rigby, John Frank Rigby, Victor Reeve Rigby, Emily Etta Rigby, Thomas Martin Rigby, Francis Edwin Rigby, Horace Durant Rigby,
2 CONC  Rowland LaVar Rigby, Thorval Eugene Rigby
