1 NAME Lucinda /Sanderson/
2 GIVN Lucinda
2 SURN Sanderson
2 _MARNM Anderson
1 SEX F
1 BIRT
2 DATE 19 AUG 1872
2 ADDR
3 CITY Fairview
3 STAE Utah Territory
3 CTRY United States
