2 CONT * '''Residence''': Same House, , - 1935
2 CONT * '''Residence''': Election District 2 Burnt Fork, McKinnon, Sweetwater, Wyoming - 1940
2 CONT * '''Residence''': Sweetwater, Sweetwater, Wyoming, United States - 21 April 1950
