1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Capt. Jacob John Odell'''
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/32537053/jacob_john-odel
2 CONT
2 CONT Captain Jacob John Odell is a military veteran of the Revolutionary War. He saw service with the Colonel John Abbot's Regiment of Foot Militia of State of Vermont.
2 CONT
2 CONT Augustine Odell Sr. (d.1785) and Elizabeth Galusha Odell of Beekman Township, Dutchess County, New York Colony and State.
2 CONT
2 CONT Jacob was married twice, first marriage in 1761 to Mary Millington (d. 1785); then in 1786 married Rebbeca Erbs (d. 1811).
2 CONT
2 CONT Jacob was born the third eldest child of parents Augustine Odell Sr. (d.1785) and Elizabeth Galusha Odell of Beekman Township, Dutchess County, New York Colony and State.
2 CONT
