2 CONT === Biography
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Phelps-1203
2 CONT
2 CONT Ruth was born in Simsbury, Hartford, Connecticut, on 15 December 1743. She is the daughter of David Phelps and Abigail Pettibone.
2 CONT
2 CONT Josiah Case of Simsbury was a Captain of Simsbury Militia who was considered a Tory. At least two formal accusations against Josiah were ﬁled with the Connecticut Assembly, but he apparently went on living in Simsbury for at least
2 CONC  most of the war. He later moved to Guilford, Connecticut, and then to Vermont.
2 CONT
