2 CONT Notes for JONATHAN MERRILL: From "A Merrill Memorial" by Samuel Merrill, Cambridge, MA 1917-1928
2 CONT
2 CONT Jonathan(4) Merrill (Daniel(3), John(2)) was born 15 Jun 1705 in Hartford, CT, and died in 1788 in Canton, CT. Aabout 1739 he removed from his home in West Hartford to a farm in the western part of Simsbury, CT adjoining New Hartf
2 CONC ord. That part of Simsbury was incorporated as a town under the name of Canton in 1806. Six families if Indians accompanied him and settled near his house. The place where they lived is still known as Indian Hills although the Ind
2 CONC ian families have long been extinct. Jonathan's wife' name is not known.
2 CONT
