2 CONC own. iii. WILLIAM MERRILL, b. 1732, West Hartford, Hartford, Conn; d. 1806, Ohio; m. SARAH KELLOGG, Bef. 1752, Hartford, Hartford, Conn; b. February 16, 1734/35, Hartford, Hartford, Conn; d. 1801, Ohio. iv. JONATHAN MERRILL, b. 17
