2 CONC , b. 1738, West Hartford, Hartford, Conn; d. Abt. 1779, Aboard Prison Ship, New York; m. SARAH CASE, Abt. 1760; b. Abt. 1740; d. Unknown. vii. SUSANNA MERRILL, b. 1742, Simsbury, Conn; d. 1810; m. DUDLEY CASE, April 29, 1763. viii
