1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Jessie Emery Hatch Obituary from The Salt Lake, Utah, Tribune, May 2, 1999:  Our beloved, sweet little brave mom and grandmother, Jessie Emery Hatch, joined her Heavenly Father, Tuesday, April 27, 1999 at age 90.  
2 CONC She was the last surviving of 11 children born to George Henry Emery and Effie Lodima Lutz on July 13, 1908 in Alta, Wyoming.  She married Golden Vance Hatch, April 27, 1927, who passed away July 1, 1965.  She married Ivan V. Hatc
2 CONC h in 1967, who passed away in 1985.  She lived with her daughter in Idaho, then returned to Utah in 1997.  Survived by two daughters, Sandra Henderson (Ray), Pat Case (John Cofer); seven grandchildren; 12 great-grandchildren; thre
2 CONC e great great-grandchildren. Preceded in death by her daughter, Dolores Bartlett, in 1991.  Funeral services will be held Tuesday, May 4, 1999 at 1 p.m. at the Russon Brothers Bountiful Mortuary, 295 North Main, where friends may 
2 CONC call from 11:30 a.m.-12:30 p.m. prior to services. Interment, Bountiful City Cemetery.
2 CONT
2 CONT Parents:
2 CONT
