1 NOTE {geni:about_me} George Martin Gale was the son of Arthur and Florence (Ricks) Gale.  He was married to Marilyn Province on October 3, 1992, at Reno, Nevada.  George served in the US Marine Corps - 1949/1966, and the US Air Force R
2 CONC eserve - 1975/1983.  He was preceded in death by his parents.  Survivors include his wife, Marilyn Gale of Cozad;  step-son, Duran Freese of Farnam;  granddaughter, Shari Cook of Farnam;  2 brothers, Jesse (Margarite) Gale of Kenn
2 CONC ewick, Washington, Ricks (Maxine) Gale of Boise, Idaho, and 2 sisters, Florence Kiholme of Boise, Idaho, June Harrison of Chesterfield, Missouri.. 
2 CONT
