1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Deseret News, June 9, 1875, Page #16:  Died at Kanab, Kane County, Utah, May 19th, Charles Hilton, after an illness of about two weeks.  Brother Hilton was comparatively but a young man, aged 27 years, 6 months and
2 CONC  21 days.  He died in full faith of the gospel, and expecting a glorious resurrection, leaving behind a wife and one child, besides a large circle of relatives and friends.
2 CONT
2 CONT SOURCE:  Find A Grave.com
