2 CONT   Charles Merrill Collett (1875 - 1969)
2 CONT   Mary Elnora Munk Collett (1877 - 1957)
2 CONT
2 CONT  Spouse:
2 CONT   James Christian Westergard (1913 - 1979)
2 CONT
2 CONT Burial: Rose Hill Cemetery  Idaho Falls Bonneville County Idaho, USA
