2 CONT Birth: 	Apr. 29, 1918 Preston Franklin County Idaho, USA
2 CONT
2 CONT Death: 	Aug. 7, 2012 Saint George Washington County Utah, USA
2 CONT
2 CONT Venus Merrill Wheeler passed away August 7, 2012.
2 CONT
2 CONT She was born in Preston, Idaho April 29, 1918 to Leslie Vinton Merrill and Marie Miller Merrill, the second of seven children.
2 CONT
2 CONT Venus married James Herbert Wheeler in the Salt Lake LDS Temple on August 27, 1940.
2 CONT
2 CONT Singing was always mother's love and she along with her two sisters, Carmen and Gwen, formed a trio that was well known throughout Cache Valley. Mom enjoyed serving missions with Dad at the Family History Library and guides at Loc
2 CONC al St. George historical sites, including the Brigham Young summer home, Temple, Tabernacle and the Jacob Hamblin home.
2 CONT
2 CONT Venus was preceded in death by her husband, Herb who passed away June 11, 2012, and her daughters: Jo Ellen Wright (Ray) and Janet Evans (Craig).
2 CONT
2 CONT She is survived by her sister, Gwen Reading (Roland); brothers: Douglas (Oksun) and Reed; children: George (Bonnie), Robert (Cathie), Stephen (Terry), Mike (Annette), Peggy, Karen and David (Anna).
2 CONT
2 CONT Metcalf Mortuary
