1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Benjamin Crane, son of Stephen Crane and Mary Denison, was born Dec. 17, 1692 in Braintree, Mass; married with ABIGAIL HOUGHTON on Dec. 27, 1722 and by whom he had eight children. He died June 24, 1771 in Milton, M
2 CONC ass. and is buried at Milton Cemetery there.
