1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Joseph Crane, eldest son of Benjamin Crane and Abigail Houghton, was born Feb. 28, 1724 in Milton, Norfolk Co., Mass,; married with MARY COPELAND, dau. of David Copeland and Elizabeth Bent, on Nov. 13, 1750 in Milt
2 CONC on, Norfolk Co., Mass. She was born Feb. 19, 1732 in Milton, Norfolk Co., Mass. He died May 29, 1755 in Milton, Mass; she died there May 28, 1766. Burial location is currently unknown. One of their children was Joseph Crane, who m
2 CONC arried Deliverance Mills and rem. to Washington, NH.
