1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Theora is pictured in the above photo standing on the left in a white blouse.  This photo was found on the website Family Search.  There is another photo under the Media Tab above which is from the Lunt Family Tree
2 CONC  on the website Ancestry.com.  Following is her obituary from the website Find A Grave.com.
2 CONT
2 CONT Theora Grant, 75, of Safford, passed away May 18, 2005, in Safford. Theora was born in Safford to Howard and Alta Morris.  She married Udell Grant, who preceded her in death.  Also preceding her in death is her sister, Ellen M. Lu
2 CONC ster.  Surviving Theora are her brother and sister, Larry H. Morris of Pima and Sharon A. Kouts of Safford.
2 CONT A visitation will be held in Theora's honor Sunday, May 22, from 6 to 8 p.m. at Bunker's Caldwell Chapel. A graveside service will follow Monday, May 23, at 9 a.m. at Mountain View Cemetery in Mesa.
2 CONT
2 CONT Arrangements are entrusted to Bunker's Caldwell chapel.
2 CONT
