2 CONT *John Kay (1836 - 1905)*
2 CONT *Thomas Kay (1838 - 1875)*
2 CONT *Henry Kay (1840 - 1911)*
2 CONT
2 CONT Burial: Mona Cemetery Mona Juab County Utah, USA
