1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Chauncey Griswold Webb married Eliza Jane Churchill, 15 Sep 1834, Kirtland, Lake, Ohio
2 CONT
2 CONT Born in Hanover, Chauqua, New York on 1812 to James Webb and Hannah Griswold. Chauncey Griswold married Eliza Jane Churchill and had 5 children. Chauncey Griswold married Louisa Goodly. Chauncey Griswold married Elizabeth Moyle. C
2 CONC hauncey Griswold married Elizabeth Lydia Taft and had 12 children. Chauncey Griswold married Eliza Price and had 8 children. He passed away on 7 Apr 1903
2 CONT
2 CONT Parents Father: James WEBB (AFN: BGL8-LC) Family Mother: Hannah GRISWOLD (AFN: 263C-R8)
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage(s) Spouse: Elizabeth MOYLE Marriage: 12 Jan 1856 Davenport, , England
2 CONT
2 CONT Spouse: Elizabeth Lydia TAFT Marriage: 21 Jan 1846 Nauvoo, Hancock, Il
2 CONT
2 CONT Spouse: Louisa GOODLY Marriage: 13 Feb 1857 Salt Lake City, Salt Lake, Utah
2 CONT
2 CONT Spouse: Eliza PRICE Marriage: 1 Mar 1857 Presidents Office, Salt Lake City, Salt Lake, Ut
2 CONT
2 CONT Spouse: Elizabeth BROWN Marriage: 7 Apr 1868 Salt Lake City, Salt Lake, Utah
2 CONT
2 CONT Spouse: Eliza Jane CHURCHILL Marriage: 15 Sep 1835 Kirtland, Lake, Oh
2 CONT
2 CONT "...Chauncey Webb was born October 24, 1812 at Hanover, Chautauqua County, New York and baptized November 24, 1834 at Kirtland, Ohio. He married Eliza J. Churchill September 16, 1834 at Kirtland, Ohio.
2 CONT
2 CONT He was a member of the Nauvoo Seventies priesthood quorum and the Nauvoo Library and Literary Institute..."
2 CONT
