2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT (son of William Wright and Margaret Ashbridge of Cumberland, England). Born October 5, 1832, Cumberland. Came to Utah in 1852.
2 CONT
2 CONT     Married:	Jemima Dands April 8, 1856, Salt Lake City (daughter of Thomas Dands and Mary Hinds of Cumberland, England, latter pioneer 1856). She was born March 10, 1833
2 CONT
2 CONT     Their children:
2 CONT
2 CONT             William T., married Ellen Charlotte Murdock;
2 CONT             Jemima A., married A. L. Penrod;
2 CONT             Margaret, married Joseph R. Murdock;
2 CONT             Wilford D., married Sarah A. Ritchie;
2 CONT             James L., married Nellie Nuttall (died), married Maggie Wilson;
2 CONT             Joseph S., married Jane Ritchie;
2 CONT             Hannah R., married A. L. Penrod;
2 CONT             Sarah E., married John M. Ritchie;
2 CONT             Hyrum S., died infant.
2 CONT
2 CONT     Married:	Mary Jane Baum October 31, 1871, at Salt Lake City.
2 CONT
2 CONT     Their children:
2 CONT
2 CONT             George Baum, married Phoebe Ritchie;
2 CONT             Eliza Jane, married Lauritz Jacobson;
2 CONT             Mary Isabel, married Elmer Penrod;
2 CONT             Owen Uria, married Matilda Casper;
2 CONT             Wallace, married Clara Bills;
2 CONT             John Elmer, married Phoebe Casper;
2 CONT             Charles, married Julia Mecham;
2 CONT             Stella Mellisa, married John Mason;
2 CONT             Elbart, died;
2 CONT             May Pearl, married Don Ivie;
2 CONT             David Nephi, died;
2 CONT             Zora, married Gordon Bills;
2 CONT             Zella;
2 CONT             Edna, died;
2 CONT             Leora;
2 CONT             Leoran Atkinson.
2 CONT
2 CONT Missionary to Great Britain 1883-84; high priest; ward clerk. Justice of peace; school trustee. Tollgate keeper. Farmer. Died November 11, 1903, Charleston, Utah. Sources:	
2 CONT
2 CONT     Pioneers and Prominent Men of Utah, page 1266
