1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Robert McCune McFarland was born September 19, 1844, in Scotland, and emigrated to Utah from in 1855 as a 10 year old boy with his parents,William McFarland (1795-1890) and Margaret McCormick McFarland (1804-1886),
2 CONC  and his three brothers and one sister.  He was married first to Mahala Jane Wilson (1844-1885).  They had nine children.  After her death, he married Josephine Mattson (1869-1959) and they had eleven children.  He farmed in West 
2 CONC Weber, Utah, and was one of the framers of the Utah State constitution. 
2 CONT
2 CONT SOURCE:  Find A Grave.com
