2 CONT [http://www.findagrave.com/cgi-bin/fg.cgi?page=gr&GSln=bunker&GSfn=emily&GSbyrel=all&GSdyrel=all&GSst=47&GScnty=2782&GScntry=4&GSob=n&GRid=23255043&df=all& Find a Grave]
