1 NOTE {geni:about_me} The certified copy of her birth record from England spells her name "Hannah Maria Septima Sims."  Daughter of George Sims and Caroline Gill.  Hannah Married Christopher Layton, 14 January 1865, Salt Lake City, Salt
2 CONC  Lake, Utah.  They had the following children - Amy Caroline Layton, Priscilla Mae Layton, Drucilla Grace Layton, Oscar George Layton, Harry Wilford Layton, Franklin Sims Layton, Jesse Monroe Layton (bio by: S.M.Smith).  There is 
2 CONC another photograph of Hannah under the Media Tab above.  
2 CONT
2 CONT NOTE:  Her husband was a Mormon polygamist who had ten wives and sixty five children.
