1 NOTE {geni:about_me} * Updated from [http://www.myheritage.com/research/collection-1/myheritage-family-trees?itemId=236369251-1-41741&action=showRecord&indId=externalindividual-2555cb3df3b7e57fc000fcdf95bd9ac0&mrid=6ba4fbbb93d00e8d1fca
2 CONC 4b4cb824f281 MyHeritage Family Trees] via husband [http://www.geni.com/profile-56017315 Frederick Layton] by [http://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Oct 18 2014, 20:07:34 UTC''
2 CONT
2 CONT Barbara Allen McGuire was married five times.  She married Fredrick C. Layton August 31, 1893, in Thatcher, Arizona;  they had 4 children and divorced July 22, 1914.  She then married John Cluff in 1914;  they had one son in 1915,
2 CONC  but he died at the age of 5 years old, and John died in 1925.  Next she married William Reuben Bingham in 1919, in Silver City, New Mexico;  he died in 1927.  She then married Caleb Hoopes February 21, 1931, but he died the follo
2 CONC wing year in 1932.  Her last marriage was to Alver Madison Farmer in 1940, and he died in 1947.  Barbara passed away 2 years later at the age of 75 on October 14, 1949.  She told her daughter Irene that her happiest times were whe
2 CONC n she was married to Reuben Bingham.
