2 ADDR
3 CITY Bloomington
3 STAE Idaho Territory
3 CTRY United States
1 DEAT
2 DATE 5 NOV 1943
2 ADDR
3 CITY Thatcher
3 STAE Arizona
3 CTRY United States
1 BURI
