2 CONT
2 CONT Son of Marion Jehu Brady & Celestial Castle Jones.
2 CONT
2 CONT Married Rintha Maria Christensen, daughter of Erastus Peter Christensen & Amelia Davis, on 26 January 1922 in Juab Co., Utah. They have three sons, Marion Berness Brady, Elwood Brady, Carroll Dee Brady and one daughter, Beverly Je
2 CONC an Brady. Marion and Rintha later divorced.
2 CONT
2 CONT Married Veda Margaret Gardner, daughter of Neil Livingston Gardner & Elizabeth Ann Thomas, on 21 November 1945 in the Salt Lake LDS Temple. At the time of their marriage, Marion was 46, a divorcee and Veda was 42, a first time bri
2 CONC de. Veda died in 1986.
2 CONT
2 CONT Marion, age 88, died in 1987.
