2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT From The Deseret News (Salt Lake City, UT) - Monday, November 7, 1966:
2 CONT
2 CONT Simpson Walton, 75, died November 4, 1966 of a heart ailment. Born Dec. 10, 1890, Woodruff, Rich County, to Wesley Kimball Walton and Frances Matilda Huffaker. Married Annie McCuaig June 29, 1914, Evanston, Wyoming.
2 CONT
2 CONT Member LDS Church.
2 CONT
2 CONT Survivors: widow, daughters: Mrs. Walther (Helen) Jacobson, Salt Lake City, Mrs Ralph (Patricia) H.P., Pakistan; 4 grandchildren; brothers, sisters, Dyke, San Jose, California; Thad, Mark, Arthur, Mrs. Vern (Evelyn) Maxwell, Mrs. 
2 CONC George (Blanche) Wells, all Salt Lake City.
2 CONT
2 CONT Funeral Wednesday noon, 260 E. South Temple. Burial Wasatch Lawn Memorial Park.
