1 OCCU
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Blanche is the thirteenth and last child of Wesley Kimball Walton and France Matilda Huffaker. She grew up on the family ranch in Woodruff going to school part-time in Salt Lake as she got older. She attended Saint
2 CONC  Marys of the Wasatch and studied art. Later Blanche attended LDS Business College taking business courses. The family was very musical and Blanche learned to play the piano and sing.
2 CONT
2 CONT Blanche went to California and while working in the office of a chain store met George E. Wells. They were married in 1924. They moved back and forth between Los Angeles and Salt Lake, wherever George could find work. They finally
2 CONC  settled permanently in Salt Lake. There they raised their son, Howard, and Blanche's widowed mother lived with them.
2 CONT
2 CONT Blanche was a member of the LDS Church. Her art training helped her as a Primary Teacher where she served for 26 years.
2 CONT --------------------
