1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Professor Vasco Myron Tanner (born October 29, 1892 in Payson, Utah) and Annie Atkin Tanner (born December 14, 1891). 
2 CONT
2 CONT Vasco and Annie married on June 5, 1917. The children of Vasco and Annie Tanner included: Carol Tanner, married Leo Evan Smith; Marilyn Tanner, married Edward Smith Murphy; Carmela Dawn Tanner, married David Pond Forsyth; Gloria T
2 CONC anner, married Maurice Smith; and V Jordan Tanner, married Pat Nowell.
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on April 25, 1989 in Provo, Utah. Interment, Provo, Utah.
