3 CITY Salt Lake City
3 STAE Utah
3 CTRY United States
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} [http://www.findagrave.com/cgi-bin/fg.cgi?page=gr&GRid=36805 Find a Grave]
2 CONT
2 CONT Birth: 	Feb. 25, 1911 Union Salt Lake County Utah, USA
2 CONT
2 CONT Death: 	Jan. 27, 1990 Salt Lake City Salt Lake County Utah, USA
2 CONT
2 CONT LORNA M. ALDER
2 CONT
2 CONT Lorna M. Alder, age 78, our special Mom and Grandmother, died January 27, 1990.
2 CONT
2 CONT She was born February 25, 1911 in Union, Utah, a daughter of Reuben H. and Millie T. Mower Forbush. On April 21, 1932 Lorna married Dr. L. Reed Alder in Salt Lake City, Utah. He preceded her in death on July 16, 1970.
2 CONT
2 CONT Lorna was a lifetime member of the Salt Lake City Dental Auxiliary and acted as secretary of both the Salt Lake and State Dental Auxiliary. She was also a longtime member of the Hygeia Ice Skating Club.
2 CONT
2 CONT Survivors include, daughter, Susan S. Alder, San Francisco, California; sons, John L. Alder, Midvale; William L. Alder, Salt Lake City; five grandchildren, Julie Alder Lawrence, Lori J. Alder, David C. Alder, Bryce R. Alder and Me
2 CONC lissa Alder Shaughnessy.
2 CONT
2 CONT She was preceded in death by a brother, Dellis R. Forbush.
2 CONT
2 CONT Graveside services will be held Tuesday, January 30, 1990, at 1:30 P.M. in the Murray City Cemetery 5600 So. and Vine Street. Friends may call at Goff Mortuary, 8090 So. State St., Midvale, Tuesday, 12 Noon to 1:00 P.M.
2 CONT
2 CONT Deseret News Monday, January 29, 1990 Obituary
2 CONT
