2 CONT Note:
2 CONT Cassville Republican, Thursday, March 15, 1951
2 CONT LAST RITES FOR FATHER OF CASSVILLE LADY
2 CONT Funeral services for George M. Stumpff, 81 years old, were held at 2:30 o'clock Sunday afternoon in the Clio church with the Rev. Clovis Cook officiating. Burial was in the church cemetery, under direction of the Culver funeral ho
2 CONC me.
2 CONT Mr. Stumpff, a retired farmer of the Crane community, died early Wednesday morning in his home there after a long illness.
2 CONT Surviving are his widow, Mrs. Anna Stumpff; three sons, Ruhl and Gerald Stumpff of Galena, and Monroe Stumpff of Jenkins; one daughter, Mrs. G. E. McNeely of Cassville; six grandchildren and two great-grandchildren.
