1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Paul Harry Weyenberg was born in Mesa, Arizona, June 3, 1930, to Harry and Nellie (Byers) Weyenberg. He grew up in Los Angeles, and joimed the U.S. Navy right out of high school. In 1956, he met and married his Nav
2 CONC y classmate, Mary Jo Ruckle. They had three children. After several military moves, the family retired to the Los Angeles area, and Paul started a second career as a computer programmer. In 1989, they made their final move to Heme
2 CONC t, where he died Thursday, May 15, 2014 at Hemet Valley Medical Center.
2 CONT
2 CONT Paul enjoyed working with wood and has a great collection of model trains.
2 CONT
2 CONT Paul is survived by his beloved wife of 57 years, Mary Joe; by son Clark and his wife Jen and children Beth, Tori, Katie, and Drew of Orange County; by daughter Kathy of Tampa, Florida; and by daughter Kerry of Orange County.
2 CONT
2 CONT Burial will be private at Riverside National Cemetery. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Paul touched many lives and will be truly missed by all those who were honored to know him and who loved him.
