1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 
2 CONT
2 CONT No will has been found for JACOB, but he and wife SUSANNAH had a son, JOHN who married FERABY CORNETT; they are buried at their home site, on the original grant, the GARNETT ANDERSON place, off Rt. 658. JACOB's daughter; REBECCA, 
2 CONC married JOHN HASH, and another daughter, NANCY, married WILLIAM HASH. Other issue of JACOB and SUSANNAH probably included THOMAS, PETER, and JACOB Jr.PETER later went to Hancock Co., TN.
2 CONT
