2 CONT Edward Barrett Pritchett, 73 years old, died February 19, 2006. Retired;served in the US Navy, engineer, Arizona miner. Visitation will be heldfrom 6:00 – 8:00 P.M. Thursday, February 23rd, at Whitney & MurphyFuneral Home, 4800 E.
2 CONC  Indian School Rd. Funeral Service will be at 11:30A.M. Friday, February 24th, also at Whitney & Murphy Funeral Home.Graveside Service 1:00 P.M. Monday, February 27th, at the NationalMemorial Cemetery of Arizona, 23029 N. Cave Cre
2 CONC ek Rd. He is survived byhis children: Sherry Chaney (husband David), Susan Pritchett, WilliamPritchett (wife Cindy), Barbara Pritchett, and Douglas Pritchett; 7grandchildren, 5 great-grandchildren; 5 brothers: James Pritchett, Fre
2 CONC dPritchett, Ken Pritchett, Lynn Pritchett and Mark Pritchett; numerousnieces, nephews, cousins and many extended family members. He waspreceded in death by his parents, 5 brothers and 1 sister. Donations maybe made in lieu of flow
2 CONC ers to Hospice of the Valley, 1510 E. FlowerStreet, Phoenix, AZ 85014.
2 CONT Published in The Arizona Republic on 2/22/2006.
