1 NAME Johanna Danielson /Peterson/
2 GIVN Johanna Danielson
2 SURN Peterson
2 _MARNM Johnson
1 SEX F
1 BIRT
2 DATE 1 OCT 1828
2 ADDR
3 CTRY Sverige
1 BURI
2 DATE 3 DEC 1907
