2 CONT 1800 Census: Jericho (now Bainbridge) Twp, Chenango Co., NY
2 CONT
2 CONT Daniel Whipple	-10 10-16 16-26 26-45 +45
2 CONT Males			 -       -        -        -       1
2 CONT Females		3       -        -        1       -
2 CONT ***************************************************************
2 CONT 1801: Tax Record, Jericho, Chenango Co., NY
2 CONT
