1 NOTE {geni:about_me} (son of Nelson Wheeler Whipple of Ohio and Rachel Keeling of Derbyshire, England). Born April 15, 1859.
2 CONT
2 CONT     Married:	Mary Roberts February 1, 1881, Lehi, Utah (daughter of John Roberts and Adelaide Ford of Lehi, pioneers 1864, Captain Ricks company). She was born July 15, 1857, Merthyr Tydfil, Wales; came to Utah with parents.
2 CONT
2 CONT     Their children:
2 CONT
2 CONT             John W. born October 19, 1881, married Clara McMillan;
2 CONT             Mabel born July 4, 1883, married Leo Jones;
2 CONT             Rachel born December 20, 1885, died infant;
2 CONT             Nelson born March 13, 1887, died infant;
2 CONT             Adelaide born May 5, 1888, died aged 10;
2 CONT             Lawrence born September 24, 1891;
2 CONT             Lillie born May 6, 1894;
2 CONT             Leslie born October 1, 1897.
2 CONT
2 CONT     Family home 28th ward. Salt Lake City.
2 CONT
2 CONT Sources:	
2 CONT
2 CONT     Pioneers and Prominent Men of Utah, page 1241
